662	/// The Changes section body: the selected workroom's branch, sync state, working-tree changes
663	/// (relative to HEAD), and CI. Reads `store.selectedTargetID` + `store.workroomStatuses`.
664	/// Covers the empty/edge states the design review enumerated: nothing selected, a project
665	/// (non-target), missing directory, still-loading, unknown (probe failed), and clean.
